nt.updatedAt?' · edited '+esc(when(appointment.updatedAt)):'')+'</p><button class="rounded-full border border-[var(--koa-line)] px-3 py-2 text-[.56rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[.06em] text-[var(--koa-forest)]">Save appointment</button></div></form>').join(''):'<p class="text-sm text-[var(--koa-ink)]/45">No appointments yet.</p>';
